repro_steps: "Inspect package.json coverageGate.sources and release:check, enumerate scripts/*.ts, and classify unique git author/committer addresses without emitting them"
expected_result: All executable TypeScript and the full physical Git history are covered by mandatory release gates
actual_result: "Only index.ts and series.ts are instrumented; three scripts, raw-object identity privacy, lint, and duplication are ungated"
component: quality/privacy
customer_impact: "A package could pass release:check while shipping untested operational logic or retaining unapproved personal history metadata"
